<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hecla Mining upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hecla Mining upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it raised its recommendation on Hecla Mining Co to market performer from underperform.</p>
<p>-- In midmorning New York Stock Exchange trade, the shares were unchanged at 6-7/8.</p>
</text>
